# Deep2 Qwen32 40TPS — Batch 3/5, item 15
# Base: Batch 1 + Batch 2 + 0011-0014.
#
# Goal:
#   - dense two-GPU models default to simultaneous row-split weight GEMVs,
#     instead of sequential contiguous layer ranges;
#   - CPU handles only cheap orchestration (RMSNorm/RoPE/softmax/SwiGLU/KV),
#     while strict mode guarantees every LinearW weight GEMV stayed on GPU;
#   - authority gate distinguishes FULL_RESIDENT_GPU from REAL_DUAL_ROW_GPU.
#
# To force old sequential resident lane:
#   DEEP2_DENSE_EXEC=LAYER_SPLIT
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0015_dense_dualrow_product_lane_and_gate.patch

